Z||000005||Bob Englert||11-05-2000||05:40 PM||||I have been using Firestone Firehawk SS10's on my 85 SE for over 2 years.  The tires now have over 35K on them and the tread looks great.  These have been excellent tires on my 4 cyl SE.  <P>While not high performance tires, they seem to be well matched to the suspension of my car.  They did great at the recent RFTH at Deal's Gap last month.<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>87 Coupe<BR>85 SE (For Sale)||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cheever2||11-05-2000||08:52 PM||||I have no complaints with Firestone.  They fixed my vibration, and I asked for good rain tires and the guy started at the low end and didn't go up unless I asked.  Other work has been reasonable too, but mostly I like that they give me specific detailed descriptions.<BR>Different shops do things differently though.<BR>  ||||reg||1
